<title>POLAND: KRAKCHEMIA 1996 GROUP RESULTS.</title>
<headline>KRAKCHEMIA 1996 GROUP RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-05-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Krakchemia SA group preliminary</p>
<p>results for the financial year ending December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>							 1996	 1995</p>
<p>    group operating profit			 6.42 vs    3.12</p>
<p>    group pre-tax profit			   3.07 vs    1.09</p>
