<p>NOTE - full company name is: Krakchemia SA</p>
<p>    group net sales				139.01 vs   96.82</p>
<p>    group costs of sales			 112.06 vs   80.08</p>
<p>    group extraordinary loss		     0.01 vs    0.00</p>
